1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,600
The harbour was empty at that hour.

2
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,240
Only the cranes, and the wind.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,960
— Are you sure it's this quay?
— Fourteen. He said it twice.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,120
Then we wait.

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,800
The freighter came in with the tide,
without a sound, as planned.

6
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,000
Nobody got off.

7
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:24,760
I counted the containers.
One was missing.

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,880
That one, of course.

9
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:31,200
— What do we do?
— We go home. We have what we need.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,320
The rain started around five.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,440
It never really stopped that week,
and number fourteen stayed empty.

12
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,600
We never spoke of it again.
